1
00:00:00,110 --> 00:00:02,470
Welcome to Elementor, this is Cassie.

2
00:00:02,649 --> 00:00:06,790
In this video, you'll learn the first steps to page building with Elementor.

3
00:00:07,169 --> 00:00:10,130
We'll begin by adding a new page in your WordPress dashboard.

4
00:00:10,470 --> 00:00:14,429
Under Pages, Add New, click Edit with Elementor.

5
00:00:14,990 --> 00:00:18,730
If you're using the new WordPress editor, you'll see the same button here.

6
00:00:19,690 --> 00:00:21,670
Okay, so what are we looking at here?

7
00:00:22,010 --> 00:00:24,949
On the right side is the editing screen of your site,

8
00:00:25,149 --> 00:00:29,010
where you add and edit elements that form the layout of your page.

9
00:00:29,010 --> 00:00:31,789
On the left side is the Elementor panel.

10
00:00:32,149 --> 00:00:34,009
Here are creative tools called widgets.

11
00:00:34,630 --> 00:00:37,009
Use widgets to add elements to your page,

12
00:00:37,250 --> 00:00:40,850
like headings, paragraphs, images, and videos.

13
00:00:41,609 --> 00:00:43,310
When you start building your page,

14
00:00:43,509 --> 00:00:46,590
design it from scratch by clicking on the plus button to add a section.

15
00:00:47,210 --> 00:00:48,829
Or use a pre-designed template.

16
00:00:49,329 --> 00:00:51,710
Hit the library icon to add a template.

17
00:00:52,310 --> 00:00:54,429
Alrighty, let's add a template together.

18
00:00:54,909 --> 00:00:57,630
First, click the magnifying glass to preview a template.

19
00:00:57,990 --> 00:00:58,990
Once you find the one,

20
00:00:59,009 --> 00:01:01,369
insert it up here on the top right.

21
00:01:02,149 --> 00:01:04,870
Let's take a closer look at the anatomy of a page.

22
00:01:05,349 --> 00:01:08,010
Each page in Elementor is made up of sections.

23
00:01:08,469 --> 00:01:10,530
This entire area is a section.

24
00:01:10,849 --> 00:01:12,150
These are also sections.

25
00:01:13,049 --> 00:01:15,930
Notice the blue border around each section on hover.

26
00:01:16,629 --> 00:01:18,430
Inside sections are columns.

27
00:01:19,209 --> 00:01:22,629
Identify them by these black dotted lines and the column icon handle.

28
00:01:23,390 --> 00:01:24,250
Here's another column.

29
00:01:24,829 --> 00:01:26,829
And inside the columns are widgets.

30
00:01:27,230 --> 00:01:28,370
Here's a text widget.

31
00:01:29,010 --> 00:01:31,150
Inside a column, inside a section.

32
00:01:31,750 --> 00:01:34,790
Use their handles to edit any element and move them around.

33
00:01:35,349 --> 00:01:37,290
Click the section handle on the left.

34
00:01:37,370 --> 00:01:39,290
The plus lets you add a new blank section.

35
00:01:39,769 --> 00:01:42,209
To edit your section, click the dots in the middle.

36
00:01:42,750 --> 00:01:45,890
This opens the panel to layout, style, and advanced.

37
00:01:46,709 --> 00:01:50,709
Move the section up or down using the middle dots by dragging and dropping.

38
00:01:51,349 --> 00:01:55,150
Here you can also right click to duplicate or delete your section,

39
00:01:55,329 --> 00:01:57,189
or copy paste, and more.

40
00:01:57,189 --> 00:01:59,170
You can do the same for a column.

41
00:01:59,349 --> 00:02:00,269
Just right click.

42
00:02:00,709 --> 00:02:01,829
Need another column?

43
00:02:02,150 --> 00:02:05,290
To add a new column, right click its handle and add.

44
00:02:05,709 --> 00:02:07,150
And do the same for widgets.

45
00:02:07,989 --> 00:02:09,710
Duplicate, delete, and copy.

46
00:02:10,090 --> 00:02:10,870
Easy peasy.

47
00:02:11,370 --> 00:02:13,569
The whole layout is super flexible.

48
00:02:13,810 --> 00:02:16,129
You can easily drag any element around.

49
00:02:16,689 --> 00:02:20,650
Change the column width by grabbing the edges and moving it left or right.

50
00:02:20,830 --> 00:02:21,469
Like this.

51
00:02:22,110 --> 00:02:23,610
Your work is saved automatically.

52
00:02:24,250 --> 00:02:26,830
If you want to publish it and view your live page,

53
00:02:27,090 --> 00:02:27,169
you can do this by dragging the edges and moving it left or right.

54
00:02:27,169 --> 00:02:29,169
Click the green publish button down here.

55
00:02:30,009 --> 00:02:32,330
Click have a look to see the published page.

56
00:02:32,889 --> 00:02:35,669
To preview your draft before you publish it,

57
00:02:35,729 --> 00:02:37,129
click the eye icon below.

58
00:02:37,650 --> 00:02:38,750
You're good to go.

59
00:02:38,969 --> 00:02:41,310
Click below the video on create new page

60
00:02:41,310 --> 00:02:43,889
to start building your very own first page.

61
00:02:44,210 --> 00:02:48,030
And be sure to explore the special getting started area to discover more.

